ctionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Any creature hit by an eternal symphony's resonant vibration Strike must succeed on a @Check[fortitude|dc:34] save or become @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round (or @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} on a critical failure).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"TV5jjpzcSehaOssK","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Accelerando","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The eternal symphony increases the tempo of its music. It gains the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} condition for 1 minute and can use the extra action each round only to Strike.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"ocUfGk4Zc68OQGBY","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Battle Symphony","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The eternal symphony plays a terrifying song of destruction in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30]. Each creature in the area takes @Damage[7d6[mental]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:36|basic] save). A creature that fails this save is also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","emotion","fear","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"2cQtp3p6PeyYRjHp","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Crescendo","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The eternal symphony gradually increases the intensity of its music. Until the end of its turn, sonic and auditory effects deal an additional 1d6 sonic damage. This effect is cumulative for each consecutive turn that the eternal symphony has used Crescendo (to a maximum of 4d6 extra sonic damage).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"crescendo","suboptions":[{"label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.Numbers.One","value":"1"},{"label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.Numbers.Two","value":"2"},{"label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.Numbers.Three","value":"3"},{"label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.Numbers.Four","value":"4"}],"toggleable":true},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":["inline-damage","resonant-vibration-damage","kick-drum-damage"],"diceNumber":"{item|flags.sf2e.rulesSelections.crescendo}","damageType":"sonic","dieSize":"d6","predicate":["crescendo"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["occult","sonic"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"d9eCCr58XjUfel6z","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Rhythmic Cadence","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The eternal symphony plays an infectious rhythm that inspires who hear it to dance uncontrollably. The eternal symphony makes two kick drum Strikes. Both attacks count toward the eternal symphony's multiple attack penalty, but the penalty increases only after both attacks. If both Strikes hit, each creature in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] must attempt a @Check[will|dc:34] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} for 1 round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","emotion","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"GkLkDFkKJGzEQCbf","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":8700000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}